  m_text: 'Experiment Log

    Test Subject: DE5i1

    We attempted to observe the
    subject using all available imaging equipment, including X-rays, CT scans, MRIs,
    and cameras, but no discernible internal structure was found.

    However, it
    was confirmed that the subject exhibits behavior similar to that of living organisms,
    such as reacting to external stimuli.

    In particular, it was observed to
    react sensitively to light and sound.


    Experiment Log

    Test Subject:
    DE5i1

    Mice, rabbits, and bears were introduced into the laboratory sequentially.

    The
    dates of introduction were June X, July X, and August X.

    Immediately after
    the test subject was discovered, all test animals exhibited extreme fear reactions.

    After
    observing the test animals for a certain period of time, DE5i1 displayed aggressive
    behavior.

    Following the attack, the animals'' bodies were so severely mutilated
    that their forms could no longer be identified, and shortly thereafter, they
    mutated into black masses.

    This black substance is designated as "Fomes."'
